{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<h2>內地手搖店×CHIIKAWA萬聖節限定</h2>\n<p>內地人氣手搖茶飲品牌「茉莉奶白」今個萬聖節首度聯乘 CHIIKAWA，推出萬聖節限定主題，全系列周邊與包裝將於 10 月 29 日起正式登場。一眾經典角色換上萬聖節限定造型，不論是怪趣吸血鬼、幽靈還是診所醫生護士造型，都增添了不少節日俏皮氛圍。\n</p>\n<h2>多款必買周邊</h2>\n<p>聯名熱飲紙杯以深黑色為主調，搭配「HAPPY HALLOWEEN」字樣、蜘蛛網及蝙蝠元素，展現濃濃怪趣風；限定主題紙袋採暗黑系設計，內壁更隱藏精美的萬聖節主題插畫，買完飲品後紙袋絕對捨不得扔。周邊方面包括角色萬聖造型壓克力立牌、透明冷飲雙層杯、金屬造型攪拌棒，以及 5 款精緻限定冰箱貼。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179283602113244350_9625281966adc81b5a0b0f.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179283602113244350_9625281966adc81b5a0b0f.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/17928360228503584_2161186326adc81b751288.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/17928360228503584_2161186326adc81b751288.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179283602448513939_14479077526adc81b8abcb6.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179283602448513939_14479077526adc81b8abcb6.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<blockquote><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/De3kHLhEzxl/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</a></p></blockquote>\n<p>\n</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T10:22:25.346541+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":389,"images":3,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T10:00:26+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T12:18:35.987605+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T10:18:25.539389+00:00","content_hash":"76bcc9f1cbbc0768b95dd1faadbca16b1a1cb197a3d8f24c0408186f55c0c24f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}